# VERIFIED 2026-07-28 on .81 (core MalditaCastilla_476a422, engine 288x216,
# single engine asserted). Screenshot at settle shows Chapter I "Colomera del
# Rey" gameplay: knight in the forest level, SPEEDRUN timer running.
#
# WHY SWORD AND NOT PAUSE: bit8 (Pause/Start) does NOT advance the game — it
# opens gmloader's OWN gamepad overlay (RESUME / DISABLE OVERLAY / KEY CONFIG
# / QUIT). That overlay renders ~168 tris and looks superficially like a game
# scene in BLITPROF, which is exactly how an earlier tuning pass mistook it for
# progress. Always confirm the scene with a screenshot, never with tri counts.
